--                                                                                     --
-- word of power is 'find'                                                             --
--                                                                                     --
-- 'find' lets you search for files and directories by name, type, or pattern.        --
--                                                                                     --
-- Think of it as sending a scout to explore every shelf and corner of the dungeon.    --
--                                                                                     --
-- To find files by name:                                                              --
-- « find . -name "pattern" »                                                          --
--                                                                                     --
-- To find only files (not directories):                                               --
-- « find . -type f »                                                                  --
--                                                                                     --
-- To find files matching a wildcard:                                                  --
-- « find . -name "dusty*" »                                                           --
--                                                                                     --
-- 'find' locates the files. 'grep' searches inside them.                              --
--                                                                                     --
-- Together, they are the most powerful scouting duo in the dungeon.                   --
--                                                                                     --
-- Try it now:                                                                         --
-- « find . -name "dusty*" »                                                           --
--                                                                                     --
